
Load Pre‑Downloaded Ollama Models into Docker
Copy tarball into container

bash
docker cp /home/appadmin/Ollama/ollama-models_20260428.tar.gz ollama:/root/
(Replace ollama with your container name if different.)

Extract inside container

bash
docker exec -it ollama bash -c "tar -xzvf /root/ollama-models_20260428.tar.gz -C /root/.ollama"
This unpacks the models/ directory into Ollama’s storage path.

Verify models

bash
docker exec -it ollama ollama list
You should see llama3.2, qwen2.5, nomic-embed-text, bge-m3, etc.
